viz-muted { fill: var(--muted); }&#10;.viz-grid { stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1; } .viz-base { stroke: var(--muted); }&#10;.viz-arrow { stroke: var(--muted); stroke-width: 1.5; } .viz-arrowhead { fill: var(--muted); }&#10;.viz rect[class^="viz-s"]:hover, .viz-seg:hover { opacity: 0.85; }&#10;.references { font-size: 0.925rem; }&#10;.references li { margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }&#10;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Bulk RNA-seq deconvolution is a computational method for estimating which cell types are present in a mixed tissue sample, and in what relative amounts, from its combined gene expression profile.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>